# Every variable is optional. With none set, the example runs against the
# built-in demo PSP (app/demo-psp), which moves no money.

# Stripe test mode: enables the CH (inline) and EU (hosted) routes.
# https://dashboard.stripe.com/test/apikeys
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...

# Polar sandbox: enables the US (hosted) route.
# Create an Organization Access Token and one product at https://sandbox.polar.sh
# POLAR_ACCESS_TOKEN=polar_oat_...
# POLAR_PRODUCT_ID=...
# POLAR_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox
